<title>NORWAY: Share, bond trading suspended again in Oslo.</title>
<headline>Share, bond trading suspended again in Oslo.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading of all stocks and bonds on the Oslo stock exchange was suspended for a second time on Tuesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>Trading was halted 11 minutes after it had resumed at 1015 GMT following technical problems earlier in the day. No reason was given for the second stoppage.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
